To prove the diagonals of square $ABCD$ are equal, $\triangle ABC$ and $\triangle DCB$ are compared. Which congruence test is used?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta,decorations.markings,calc}
\tikzset{tk/.style={postaction={decorate,decoration={markings,mark=at position 0.5 with {\draw (0pt,-4pt)--(0pt,4pt);}}}}}
